      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FEARFUL (7) settled near the pace and finished well to finish a very close third last start over 1609m at Menangle. Drawn to enjoy a nice run, with luck possibly playing a role at some point. Leading hope based on that recent effort. FREASON (1) has been racing well from some tough draws including a Goulburn win two back. Should get every chance from the inside barrier. ARMA THE GREAT (5) was out of the money two runs back at Riverina Paceway then improved sharply last start to score by a head at the same circuit. Meets a similar line up so could make it two on the bounce. OAK RIDGE (2) is in the mix following a fourth at his most recent appearance over 1770m at this track. Include in combinations.",
